This formalization provides technical architectural context aligned with AOE3-STD-001 — Governance & Architectural Authority. Within AOE3, consequential execution requires a fail-closed authorization posture in which the Execution Boundary is independently governed within its defined scope and produces evidence suitable for subsequent verification.

